                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.5532/15: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-12-15T10:00:00-03:00">December 15, 1930—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 15—9:35 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>167. Department’s telegram No. 95, December 6, noon. Brazilian Government is
                    agreeable to designation of Lieutenant Commander Blandy as Naval Attaché of this
                    Embassy.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
